			<div class="content" id="post-content-2557304">
									

<p>Here it is: my loving tribute to pulp noir stories, placed in the SCP Foundation setting.</p>
<p>My thanks go out to LadyKatie, Jacob Conwell, and WrongJohnSilver for giving my draft attention in the forums (and to Zyn for helping steer people toward that thread). Also to everyone who took time to put eyes on it for me in chat!</p>

							</div>

								
					
