						<a class="title" href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,2557304)"></a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2362395); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2362395&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608045290" alt="Boogey_Man23" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2362395)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2362395); return false;" >Boogey_Man23</a></span>, <span class="odate time_1471000548 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">12 Aug 2016 11:15</span>
