														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2558434">
									

<p>First, thanks for the feedback!</p>
<p>While seeking critique before posting I came to find that something of this style just may not be to the tastes of many readers on the site, or might not fit well in the SCP-verse setting (or rather, that making it fit well could be beyond my ability). And I might have pulled myself in multiple directions, instead of fully committing to one way or the other (which is, of course, entirely on me).</p>
<p>I'll hopefully learn what I can from this, and improve on my next attempt.</p>

